From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:14:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: fix read_opt, scratch_zero and safety_poll_ms
 at their defaults

These were same-boot A/B knobs whose results are settled, and every boot
runs their defaults:
- read_opt=1: cached admission cursors, the notifier count read through the
  retire snapshot, the already-reached test from the last scan, and wedge
  sampling at most every 50 ms;
- scratch_zero=1: a reused lease clears only its metadata pages (full VK
  CTS clean since #181);
- safety_poll_ms=50: the pump rechecks completion every 50 ms with work
  outstanding.
Remove the parameters, their debugfs files and the alternative paths.
Production behaviour is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
